        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108879845?u=eeb9306682180ab80521c80fd8f46609fe3c6770&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The output of the <code class=\"notranslate\">update-browser-releases</code> script is:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">@mdn/browser-compat-data@7.3.9 update-browser-releases<br>\nnode scripts/update-browser-releases/index.js --all</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-info mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Note</p><p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Chrome for Desktop</strong>: Ignoring current version 147, which is not yet released (stable date is 2026-04-07).</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-info mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Note</p><p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Chrome for Android</strong>: Ignoring current version 147, which is not yet released (stable date is 2026-04-07).</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-info mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Note</p><p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Webview for Android</strong>: Ignoring current version 147, which is not yet released (stable date is 2026-04-07).</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-info mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Note</p><p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Opera for Desktop</strong>: No release announcement found among 10 items in <a href=\"https://blogs.opera.com/desktop/category/stable-2/feed/\" rel=\"nofollow\">this RSS feed</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Updates for Safari for Desktop</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>New release detected for safari: Version 26.5 as a beta release.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Updates for Safari for iOS</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>New release detected for safari_ios: Version 26.5 as a beta release.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Updates for WKWebView for iOS</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>New release detected for webview_ios: Version 26.5 as a beta release.</li>\n</ul>",
